IOR YEAR'S FIRST QUARTER REVENUE OF $487.9 MILLION."}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-04-29 11:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Vaccines boost U.S. bank earnings outlook, according to S&P Global Market Intelligence's annual U.S. Bank Market Reports", 'text': "NEW YORK, APRIL 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMMUNITY BANKS AND THEIR LARGER COUNTERPARTS STAND TO REPORT FAR FEWER LOAN LOSSES THAN PREVIOUSLY EXPECTED, ACCORDING TO S&P GLOBAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE'S ANNUAL U.S. BANK AND U.S. COMMUNITY BANK MARKET REPORTS. THE TWO NEW REPORTS CONCLUDE THAT THE OUTLOOK FOR BANK RETURNS IS FAR MORE FAVORABLE NOW THAN EVEN A FEW MONTHS AGO AS CREDIT COSTS SHOULD BE SIGNIFICANTLY LOWER THAN PREVIOUSLY EXPECTED DUE TO THE ACCELERATED PACE OF VACCINATIONS AND ADDITIONAL GOVERNMENT STIMULUS."}{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2021-04-29 06:05:00-04:56', 'title': 'Stanley Black & Decker, Inc. to Redeem Its Series C Cumulative Perpetual Convertible Preferred Stock', 'text': 'NEW BRITAIN, CONN., APRIL 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0STANLEY BLACK & DECKER, INC. (NYSE: SWK) ("STANLEY") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ELECTED TO REDEEM ALL ITS OUTSTANDING SERIES C CUMULATIVE PERPETUAL CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK (CUSIP NO.'}{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2021-04-29 06:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Stanley Black & Decker Reports Record 1Q 2021 Results', 'text': 'NEW BRITAIN, CONN., APRIL 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE: SWK) TODAY ANNOUNCED FIRST QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS.'}{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2021-04-29 12:45:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ron Phillips Joins Sysco as Executive Vice President, Chief Human Resources Officer', 'text': 'HOUSTON, APRIL 29, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SYSCO CORPORATION (NYSE:SYY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT RON PHILLIPS WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER, EFFECTIVE MAY 3, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2021-04-29 09:10:00-04:56', 'title': 'T-Mobile 5G is Fastest and Most Available According to Millions of Real Customer Experiences A